# babylon-jump.png

VE screenshot for issue #81 (server-authoritative spacebar jump).

## How to capture

1. Start local SpacetimeDB: `./tools/scripts/ensure-local-spacetime.sh`
2. Publish module: `cd server && spacetime publish fardel --yes`
3. Start web client: `cd web && npm run dev`
4. Open browser: `http://localhost:5173/?ve=jump`
5. Wait for "Jump OK" message showing Y > 0.3m
6. Take screenshot (browser devtools or OS screenshot tool)
7. Save as `ve/babylon-jump.png`
8. Force-add to git: `git add -f ve/babylon-jump.png`
9. Amend commit: `git commit --amend --no-edit`
10. Force push: `git push -f origin cursor/fix-jump-space-ec43`

## Expected screenshot content

- Player character in mid-air (Y > 0.3m from ground)
- Keybind legend panel open (H key) showing "Space jump"
- Persist mark showing jump success message
- Camera angle capturing vertical displacement

The screenshot proves:
- Server-authoritative Y position working
- Space key binding functional
- Gravity + ground clamp physics working
- Keybind legend updated with Space
